    "bake-off runs. If they disagree, the benchmark recommends a model on",
    "numbers the product will not reproduce.",
    "Asserted by ml/tests/test_notulen_bench.py and by",
    "rust_core/src/notulen/parity.rs — both read this file, so neither side",
    "can be fixed by editing its own copy of the expectations."
